WinZip 6.3 (SR-1) for Windows 3.1 & Workgroups
Features built-in ZIP & UNZIP w/disk spanning
and MIME, UUencode, BinHex, TAR, gzip support.
Includes tight integration w/the Windows 95
shell:  drag and drop TO or FROM the Explorer
or ZIP and UNZIP without leaving the Explorer
1997*People's Choice Award, SIC
1997*Editor's Pick Award Home Office Computing
1996*Best Utility PC Magazine Shareware Award
1996*Best of the Internet Award, PC Computing
